"notes":[
"Anonymous usage data and crash reports, to balance the game from real matches and fix bugs nobody reported. At the end of each match the game sends your hero, the mode and map, the match length and result, and your kills, deaths, damage and gold sent, and which heroes won (for hero win rates). If the game closed unexpectedly or hit an error, the next launch sends a crash report (with the last lines of the log, chat lines left out).",
"None of it carries your profile name, account, friends or chat: just a random ID made on your PC. Settings > Online > Privacy > \"Share usage & crash data\" turns it all off (and drops anything not sent yet)."
]
